-- HOLE IN AN HTML COMMENT -------------------------------------- main.kl  K1615

This hole is inside an HTML comment. Comments are sent to the browser, and a value containing `-->` would end the comment and become markup.

3│     let page = html"""<p>hi<!-- {name} --></p>"""
                                    ^^^^

Help: Move the value out of the comment, or use a Kalam `#` comment, which is never sent.

Learn more: kalam explain K1615
